<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">văpĭdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		vapor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that has emitted steam</i> or <i>vapor</i>, i.
			e. <i>that has lost its life and spirit</i>, <i>spoiled</i>, <i>flat</i>, <i>vapid.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 5, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>spoiled</i>, <i>bad.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 148</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">astutam vapido servas sub pectore vulpem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 117</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">văpĭdē</span></b> , <i>poorly</i>, <i>badly</i>, <i>ill</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se habere, for male se habere, a favorite
					expression of Augustus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 87</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
